## 5. LIVE PHOTO UPDATES

This is a critical requirement.

When a visitor uploads a photo successfully:

- The photo must become available to the slideshow.
- The slideshow should retrieve newly uploaded photos automatically.
- The visitor should not need to refresh the TV browser manually.

Use an appropriate real-time approach based on the existing project.

Polling is acceptable if implemented efficiently.

For example:

- Check for newly available photos every few seconds.
- Avoid reloading the complete page.
- Avoid restarting the current slide unnecessarily.
- Avoid duplicate photo entries.

Do not introduce unnecessary WebSocket infrastructure.

## 6. RETURNING VISITORS

